		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Elder Rise is the north-eastern bluff of {link:thunder-bluff}Thunder Bluff{/link}, the home of the city's wise ones. The druids of the {link:cenarion-circle}Cenarion Circle{/link} keep their lodges here under {link:hamuul-runetotem}Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem{/link}, with his daughter Bashana, the young druid {link:nara-wildmane}Nara Wildmane{/link} and the teachers of the druidic arts beside them. In a lodge of her own, guarded by two warriors of her clan, lives {link:magatha-grimtotem}Magatha Grimtotem{/link}, the Elder Crone. The two elders share the same rise and seldom the same mind. Those who seek counsel on the troubles of the land, whether of spirits, dreams or the earth itself, are sent here.]=],
