			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Cairne Bloodhoof is the High Chieftain of the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} and the founder of {link:thunder-bluff}Thunder Bluff{/link}. He was once the chief of a single tribe, the Bloodhoof, who wandered the plains near the Great Sea and lived in fear of the {link:centaurs}centaur{/link}. He is now the lord of all the tauren tribes and one of the great pillars of the {link:horde}Horde{/link}. Age has slowed him, but it has not bent him. He is a peerless warrior, a patient judge and a friend to those who honor the land.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Cairne gave his people a home. It was his alliance with {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} that saved the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} from the {link:centaurs}centaur{/link}, and his word that bound them to the {link:horde}Horde{/link}. Through him the Horde gained more than warriors: it gained a people of deep wisdom and old faith. In these days the High Chieftain still holds the tribes together, though not all of them agree with where he leads.]=],
