			text = [=[Before the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} had a home, the {link:centaurs}centaur{/link} hunted Cairne's people from one camp to the next. When the young warchief {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} came upon them in battle, Cairne saw in the orcs a people as savage as they were noble. He told Thrall of the Oracle in the north. Thrall in turn swore to guard the tauren caravans across the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}, and the orcs fought off wave after wave of centaur until the tauren reached {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}. Cairne did not forget the debt. He followed Thrall to {link:stonetalon-mountains}Stonetalon{/link}, and from that day the tauren marched with the {link:horde}Horde{/link}.]=],
