			text = [=[The news that the Galak had dared to raid {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link} stirred the old warrior's anger. He had driven the {link:centaurs}centaur{/link} from these plains beside {link:thrall}Thrall{/link}, and he honored those who drove them out again, so that the centaur would remember the pain that awaits them if they return.]=],
