			text = [=[Magatha Grimtotem is the Elder Crone of {link:grimtotem-clan}the Grimtotem{/link}, a shaman whom many count the most powerful of the {link:tauren}tauren{/link}, and one of the oldest of their elders. She dwells in a lodge on {link:elder-rise}Elder Rise{/link}, attended by two warriors of her clan and by her servant Rahauro. Many come to her for counsel, and she gives it gladly. What she wants in return, few can say.]=],
