			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Magatha is the great rival of {link:cairne-bloodhoof}Cairne Bloodhoof{/link}. She has sought power and standing nearly all her life, and she believes that she alone is fit to lead the {link:tauren}tauren{/link}. The warriors of her clan follow her, and they dream of driving the lesser races from {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link}. Yet she lives in the High Chieftain's city, sits among his elders and speaks for the {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link}, whom she has helped more than any other tauren has.]=],
