			text = [=[Hamuul opened the old ways of the night elves to the {link:tauren}tauren{/link}. Because of him, druids of both peoples now work side by side, and his lodge on {link:elder-rise}Elder Rise{/link} is where the tauren turn when the land itself falls sick.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He sends the young to aid the druids who search for a strange power leaking into the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}.
• He entered the dreaming to learn what poisons the Barrens.
• He advises young druids to look beyond the quarrels of peoples in their dealings with the Circle.
• He studies the soil of {link:un-goro-crater}Un'Goro{/link} and the growth of morrowgrain.]=],
		},
	},
