			hint = "Bring the tainted shells of the Barrens to the Arch Druid.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 1489 },
			},
			text = [=[The taint in the oases of the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link} led to the {link:wailing-caverns}Wailing Caverns{/link}. Hamuul entered the land of dreams and saw a cult of druids there, once noble, who had lost their way and now served the taint. He was old, and he could not stay long in the dream. Young {link:nara-wildmane}Nara Wildmane{/link} stayed when he fled.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "a-shard-of-nightmare",
			title = "A Shard of Nightmare",
			hint = "Deliver a strange shard to the Arch Druid.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 3369 },
			},
			text = [=[A shard of the {link:emerald-dream}Emerald Dream{/link} came to him from a druid who would not speak of it. Hamuul looked into it, fell silent, and said only that things in the Dream were not as the druids had thought. He advised that it was not wise to speak of such matters.]=],
