			},
			text = [=[When {link:mull-thunderhorn}Mull Thunderhorn{/link} reported that the three wells of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link} had been cleansed, Hamuul said that joy was running through the streams again, for the wells serve the beasts as well as the people.]=],
