Add({
	kind = "topic",
	id = "grimtotem-clan",
	title = "Grimtotem Clan",
	aliases = { "Grimtotem clan", "Grimtotem tribe", "the Grimtotem" },
	category = "group",
	region = "thunder-bluff",
	unlock = {
		{ type = "read" },
	},
	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Grimtotem are a {link:tauren}tauren{/link} clan unlike the others. Where most tauren seek harmony with the land, the Grimtotem seek to master it. They believe that the lesser races should be driven from {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link} and that the tauren should take back the lands of their ancestors. Their matriarch is {link:magatha-grimtotem}Magatha{/link}, the Elder Crone, and their warriors follow her.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Clan and the City",
			text = [=[{link:magatha-grimtotem}Magatha{/link} lives on {link:elder-rise}Elder Rise{/link} in {link:thunder-bluff}Thunder Bluff{/link}, guarded by warriors of her clan, and the Grimtotem there enjoy the rights of any {link:tauren}tauren{/link}. It is said that {link:cairne-bloodhoof}Cairne{/link} gave her a place so near him in the spirit of an old saying: keep your friends close and your enemies closer. Out in the wild lands, the clan is another matter.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "In the Wild Lands",
			text = [=[• {b}{link:thousand-needles}Thousand Needles{/link}.{/b} The Grimtotem hold the {link:darkcloud-pinnacle}Darkcloud Pinnacle{/link}, where they bury their dead beside a sacred fire. The {link:tauren}tauren{/link} of {link:freewind-post}Freewind Post{/link} watch them closely. Agents of unknown origin have been seen visiting them, and an outcast of the clan, {link:arnak-grimtotem}Arnak{/link}, is wanted for murder and kidnapping.
• {b}The {link:stonetalon-mountains}Stonetalon Mountains{/link}.{/b} Grimtotem raiders fell upon a tauren village near the mountains and killed nearly everyone in it.
• {b}The {link:earthen-ring}Earthen Ring{/link}.{/b} Not every Grimtotem walks the clan's path. In these days a shaman named Yorn Grimtotem serves with the Earthen Ring in {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}.]=],
		},
	},
})
